			"notes": "## 1.3.0 — 2026-10-06\n- LODs download in the background with a progress toast; keep playing.\n- Downloads resume after interruption or restart, retry automatically, and are SHA-256 verified.\n- Choose **Install Now** or **Install When I Leave** once the download finishes (`/wynn_lod_install`).\n- New install screen replaces \"Disconnected\": live progress, auto-rejoin after Install Now, **Retry** on failure.\n- Installs replace whole LOD folders (no stale files) and roll back on failure.\n- Update notice when new LODs are published; LOD manifest now lives on `master`.\n- `/wynn_lod_cancel` stops a download or discards a staged one."
		},
